# Local backup archives are not distribution assets. The official workflow
# archive is re-included explicitly below.
*.zip

# Internal source/development records and the source-tree Manifest are not part
# of the Registry archive. REGISTRY_MANIFEST.sha256 covers the staged package.
AGENTS.md
PROJECT_STATE.md
WORKLOG.md
MANIFEST.sha256

# Repository-only automation and test configuration are not runtime assets.
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
pytest.ini

# Ship current V3.9 and retained V3.8X2 public contracts. Historical validation notes,
# version-specific design documents, and their screenshots stay in source.
